Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Other Types of Machine Learning", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"31c0cc67-ce1a-4568-81a7-140d51ff63b5"],

Cell["\<\
There are other types of machine learning that you will hear about that were \
developed to meet the specific needs of the problems they were trying to \
solve. They can be considered variations or hybrids of the three core \
paradigms: supervised, unsupervised and reinforcement learning.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4aa9d349-7c4a-4580-891a-4107536d2cec"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Semi-supervised Learning", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"01ccd9af-0f08-4a56-af96-894f8f0eedc3"],

Cell["A smaller set of labeled data", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1878fa73-974d-4f7f-b32a-9eedcd61a1c5"],

Cell["Lots of unlabeled data", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4c26a72d-9f65-4c56-8fdd-25fe2f114857"],

Cell["Trained to produce a predictive model", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b1dcbff3-636c-4fcd-9ff6-de73c91ae85e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Deep Learning", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"f3624c64-e6e1-4915-9721-4224995cde6b"],

Cell["\<\
Subset of machine learning; machine learning using neural networks\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a48d8dfa-9e10-4919-8225-36476f00385a"],

Cell["\<\
Many nodes (modeled like \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]artificial neurons\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]) connected together in layers\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"764582c4-48c9-42ee-8c27-b8a371ac35b7"],

Cell["\<\
Many layers in the network; Input layer, hidden layers and output layer; deep \
refers to many hidden layers\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6250af75-8d83-425a-9475-a66d42b8f8f7"],

Cell["\<\
Transformers are a popular model; other models like CNNs, RNNs, VAEs, GANs, \
etc.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"203e98da-d800-4d8f-896c-1ec97c692485"],

Cell["\<\
Trained on lots and lots of data using a lot of processing power (e.g. GPUs \
and cloud)\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"7cfb1e2e-3f9e-4351-b886-150d14c5530b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Generative AI", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"810b877a-d296-4312-b475-711338340b59"],

Cell["\<\
Uses combination of supervised, semi-supervised and unsupervised learning\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f78ab21a-b954-43db-ba97-653175c5bbe9"],

Cell["Implemented using neural networks", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"de191c1e-08c0-4d02-aa20-95bc3cbd76dc"],

Cell["Can generate text, images, audio and video", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f9e08840-7021-45fe-8b35-7000360dd47e"],

Cell["\<\
Popular text applications: ChatGPT, Claude, Bard, Copilot, etc.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1fa28116-f48e-4dec-8999-c07cdee7c52a"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

